403	 * "(healthy)", or `timeoutMs` elapses. Relies on a real `healthcheck:`
404	 * block existing on that service in docker-compose.yml — never
405	 * fabricates readiness for a service with no healthcheck (e.g.
406	 * apps/worker, which has none — see docker-compose.yml's comment on why).
