963	    // — the identical overrides `discoverVolumes` above uses to resolve
964	    // the configuration being torn down. This is the fix: a destructive
965	    // or volume-preserving cleanup command must never run against a
966	    // DIFFERENT environment than the one its own ownership gate just
967	    // validated against.
968	    removeContainersKeepingVolumes: () => removeContainersKeepingVolumesOrThrow(project, { timeoutMs: 180000, env }),
